    "description": {
      "value": "You temporarily morph your limb into a clawed appendage.\n\nMake a melee spell attack roll against your target's AC.\n\nIf you hit, you deal your choice of slashing or piercing damage equal to 1d6 plus your spellcasting ability modifier.\n\nOn a critical success, you deal double damage plus 1d4 persistent bleed damage."
    },
    "higher_level_description": {
      "value": "Heightened (+1): The damage increases by 1d6 and the persistent bleed damage on a critical increases by 1d4."
    },
